<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>前往付款中…</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; background: #111111; }
    .box { text-align: center; }
    .spinner {
      width: 160px; height: 160px; margin: 0 auto 32px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: conic-gradient(#d33023 0deg 120deg, #2253a8 120deg 240deg, #f4c027 240deg 360deg);
      -webkit-mask: radial-gradient(farthest-side, transparent 62%, #000 63%);
      mask: radial-gradient(farthest-side, transparent 62%, #000 63%);
      animation: spin 1.2s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
    p { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #f7f3ea; text-transform: uppercase; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="spinner"></div>
    <p>正在前往綠界付款頁面，請稍候</p>
  </div>

  <form id="ecpay-form" method="POST" action="<%= aioUrl %>">
    <% for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(params)) { %>
    <input type="hidden" name="<%= key %>" value="<%= value %>" />
    <% } %>
  </form>

  <script>document.getElementById('ecpay-form').submit();</script>
</body>
</html>
